<!--
  Three URLs, and that is not an oversight.

  The shop's pages are hash routes — #/collections, #/about — and a search
  engine does not treat a fragment as a separate page. Everything after the #
  is, to Google, the same document as "/". So listing them here would be
  listing one URL nine times.

  Making those into real, indexable pages means moving off hash routing onto
  real paths, which is a genuine piece of work rather than a line in a file.
  See docs/outstanding.md.
-->
